&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; development budget of €1000 per year and a transparent growth framework to support your career goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and a variable remuneration program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly meal allowance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deutschland ticket subsidy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;28 vacation days, increasing by 2 days after 2 years and 3 days after 3 years with Solaris.&lt;/li&gt;
